#. Name of the theme
msgid "Neubau"
msgstr "Neubau"

#. Description of the theme
msgid ""
"neubau is a modern, minimal, responsive portfolio/business theme by "
"Elmastudio. neubau offers a with a custom front page, a fullscreen slider "
"option, a team, services, portfolio and testimonials page template and many "
"more features."
msgstr ""

#. URI of the theme
msgid "https://www.elmastudio.de/en/themes/neubau/"
msgstr ""

#. Author of the theme
msgid "Elmastudio"
msgstr "Elmastudio"

#. Author URI of the theme
msgid "https://www.elmastudio.de/en/"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"<strong>%s</strong> supports automatic updates using WordPress' update "
"mechanism. To use this feature you need to activate the theme using your "
"Product Key, which can be found in your Elmastudio account dashboard. The "
"theme stays fully functional without activation and still can be updated "
"manually. %sClick here%s to activate <strong>%s</strong>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%s</strong> unterstützt automatische Updates über den "
"Aktualisierungsmechanismus von WordPress. Dazu muss das Theme mit einem "
"Produktschlüssel aktiviert werden, den du in deinem Elmastudio-Konto findest."
" Das Theme funktioniert uneingeschränkt auch ohne diese Aktivierung und "
"lässt sich jederzeit manuell aktualisieren. %sKlicke hier%s um <strong>"
"%s</strong> zu aktivieren."

msgid ""
"<b>Warning!</b> You're blocking external requests which means you won't be "
"able to get %s updates. Please add %s to %s."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Achtung!</strong> Du blockierst externe Anfragen, so dass keine %s-"
"Updates geladen werden können. Bitte füge %s zu deinen %s hinzu."

